       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Dose:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. The maximum labeled dose for adults is 3,200 mg/day, and that is for prescription use under supervision.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** A dose this high raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even when kidney and liver function are normal.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, 4 times daily** (3,200 mg/day), the usual maximum\n- **800 mg by mouth, 3 times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth, every 6 hours**, for typical analgesic or anti-inflammatory dosing\n- **1600 mg total per day**, divided into doses\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that it's intentional and give the clinical rationale. I would still suggest checking with pharmacy before I enter it."
